/ActualText (Empirical researcher and software engineer completing an MSc in Artificial Intelligence \(September 2026\). My dissertation quantitatively investigates how people accept, trust, and rely on AI generated recommendations. Fluent in Python with a full stack engineering background, and experienced in experimental design, mixed effects modelling, and natural language processing. Motivated by making AI safe and beneficial for society, and seeking to move into full time empirical AI research.)
